# Build / test artifacts
/bin/
*.out
*.test
*.prof
coverage.*
# Stray command binaries: `go build ./internal/<cmd>` drops a same-named
# executable in cwd (usually repo root). Anchored to / so the internal/<cmd>
# source dirs are NOT ignored. Keep in sync with internal/*/ package main dirs.
/capprobe
/cichange
/exportgguf
/mdlint
/rendertables

# Golden generation scratch (keep committed golden files under */testdata/)
*.tmp
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.venv-cuda/

# Editor/OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/

# Claude Code local/session files — but KEEP .claude/workflows/ (the research-lite
# plugin lives in-repo so it travels to other hosts, e.g. Linux/Windows for the
# CUDA/AMD/Intel accel work).
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# NOTE: the compiled Vulkan shader backend/vulkan/shaders/matmul.spv is
# intentionally COMMITTED (embedded build artifact, wanted in-repo) — not ignored.

# fetched model weights (never commit — multi-GB); keep the README
models/*
!models/README.md
